@startuml
title Figure 11. Login, Token Issuance, and Protected Request
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 65
actor User
boundary "Next.js UI" as UI
control "Nginx Gateway" as GW
control "Identity AuthController" as IC
control "Identity AuthService" as IS
control "Protected Service Guard" as Guard
control "Tenant/Admin Authorization" as Authz
database PostgreSQL as DB
User -> UI : Submit credentials
UI -> GW : POST /auth/login
GW -> IC : Route request
IC -> IS : authenticate(email, password)
IS -> DB : Read normalized user and status
IS -> IS : Verify password and email state
IS -> DB : Create hashed refresh token
IS --> UI : Access JWT + secure refresh cookie
User -> UI : Request protected operation
UI -> GW : Request with JWT
GW -> Guard : Route without business authorization
Guard -> Guard : Verify signature, expiry, claims locally
Guard -> Authz : Authorize tenant, role, ancestry
Authz -> DB : Read membership and organization scope
Authz --> UI : Authorized response or 403
@enduml



